# Research tools

## Context7 MCP

- Use Context7 when you need library/API docs.
- If known, pin the library with slash syntax (e.g., `use library /supabase/supabase`).
- Mention the target version.
- Fetch minimal, targeted docs; summarize (no large dumps).

## Web search policy

- Enable and use web search only when it materially improves correctness (e.g.,
  up-to-date APIs, recent advisories, release notes).
- Prefer official docs and primary sources; otherwise use Context7 MCP or
  reputable, widely-cited references.
- Record source dates (publish/release dates) when relevant.
